      "description": "Casting Sever the Bloodline before playing a land drop. Also, targeting Phantom Steed while Chasm Skulker (growing each turn with Howling Mine) and Oath of Druids (which can cheat massive creatures into play) are arguably bigger threats. Sever can't hit enchantments though, and Chasm Skulker creates tokens when it dies, making exile from Sever strong against it.",
