    {
      "severity": "questionable",
      "description": "Chasm Skulker is a growing threat that gets bigger with every card draw (especially with Howling Mine on the battlefield giving extra draws), and when it dies it creates tokens equal to its counters. Phantom Steed is a 4/3 that can flicker creatures but Gem25F Analyst doesn't have particularly threatening ETB creatures right now. The Skulker will grow rapidly with Howling Mine active and becomes increasingly dangerous over time, plus it creates a board of tokens on death. However, Sever the Bloodline exiles the target (preventing Skulker's death trigger), which is actually a strong argument for targeting Skulker - exile cleanly removes it without giving tokens. Phantom Steed is the bigger body right now but doesn't scale.",
