      "decision_index": 1475,
    },
    {
      "severity": "questionable",
      "description": "Attacking Gem25F Analyst at 45 life instead of Sonnet Timmy at 38 life with the Lightning Rager token. 5 damage is proportionally more impactful against the lower life total player, and neither has blockers.",
